w01_ehsign.py  --  E[H_vv] 在 theta=pi 上的符号: p05 [T] vs v04 [C]
定义见文件头 [S1]-[S5].   beta=2.5, theta=pi, SU(2)/SU(3).

==============================================================================
[A] SU(2), theta=pi  (phi0 = pi/2),  H_vv = d_tau^2 S_W,  v = e_3,  切片 x_3 = 0
    闭式 (解析): H_vv = beta * cos(theta/2) * sin(u)/(4u),  u = |x|/2   [T]
    theta=pi => cos(theta/2)=0 => H_vv = 0 【逐点恒等】, 与测度/与 beta 无关
    theta=pi      E[H_vv]_FD = -4.512868069571047e-10   E[H_vv]_closed = +2.363905825594736e-17   (|diff| = 4.5e-10)
    theta=0       E[H_vv]_FD = +5.149315278006742e-01   E[H_vv]_closed = +5.149315252383198e-01   (|diff| = 2.6e-09)
    theta=0.7pi   E[H_vv]_FD = +2.071387539240368e-01   E[H_vv]_closed = +2.071387518295823e-01   (|diff| = 2.1e-09)
    => theta=pi: 0 是【精确恒等式】, 不是数值小量; theta=0 复现 p05 的 +0.553061

