[B] SU(2) 锚点: theta=0, beta=2.5 -> E[H_vv] 应为 +0.553061 (p05 §2 / O21)
    E[H_vv](theta=0, beta=2.5) = 0.514931525   [p05: 0.553061]  diff = 3.8e-02

