[C] SU(3), theta=pi (W=diag(-1,-1,1), phi=(pi,pi,0)), beta=2.5, 无条件 Weyl cell (M1)
    w = |Delta|^2 e^{-S_W},  S_W = beta(1-(1/3) sum_j cos(phi_j-x_j))
    规范 H_vv = +(beta/3) sum_j lam_j^2 cos(phi_j - x_j)   [= d_tau^2 S_W, 由真真空凸性定号]
    => H_vv(lam) 对 lam 是【线性】: E[H_vv] = (beta/3)( lam3^2 c3 - lam1^2 c1 - lam2^2 c2 )
       c_j := <cos x_j>_w  (phi=(pi,pi,0): cos(phi_j-x_j) = -cos x_j (j=1,2), +cos x_j (j=3))

